<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48555" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θέσφᾰτ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεός, φημί</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>spoken by God, decreed</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μόρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					1321
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἥκει θ. βίου τελευτή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OC</u>
					1472
				</span></i>
			: mostly in phrase <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θέσφατόν
			ἐστι</span>, it is <i>ordained</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὣς γὰρ θ. ἐστι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					8.477
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IA</u>
				1556
			</span></i>: c. dat. pers. et inf., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σοὶ δ᾽ οὐ θ. ἐστι . . θανέειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					4.561
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				10.473
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				4.71
			</span></i>, Orac.in <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pax</u>
				1073
			</span></i>; so 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴ τι θ. πατρὶ . . ἱκνεῖθ᾽, ὥστε
					πρὸς παίδων θανεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OC</u>
					969
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			Subst.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θέσφατα, τά</span>, <i>divine decrees, oracles</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				11.151
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				297
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παλαίφατα θ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				13.172
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>I.</u>
				8(7).34
			</span></i>: sg., <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IT</u>
				121
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> generally,
				<i>wonderful, mighty</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀήρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					7.143
				</span></i>
			.—Cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεσπέσιος,
			θέσκελος</span>.</div>
